# Git worktrees
.worktrees/

# Secrets — never commit
.env
*.env.local

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# ClaudIA data — the whole directory. It holds only runtime/private artefacts:
# claudia.db (conversation history), the IBKR Flex archive, and session reports.
# Ignored wholesale rather than by enumerated subpath, because the enumerated form
# left any *new* data/ file unignored — that is the shape of the docs/versions/ leak
# (security-audit-2026-07-25.md, H-2). Nothing in data/ is tracked; if something ever
# needs to be, un-ignore it explicitly with a `!data/<file>` negation.
data/

# Private documents — never commit
docs/context.md
docs/principles.md
docs/versions/

# Coverage
.coverage

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# TradingView MCP vendor archive — ARCHIVE_INFO committed; binaries/deps are not
vendor/tradingview-mcp/index.js
vendor/tradingview-mcp/src/
vendor/tradingview-mcp/node_modules/
vendor/tradingview-mcp/package-lock.json

# Playwright MCP session artifacts — console logs, page snapshots (ephemeral debug output)
.playwright-mcp/

# All plans are personal working documents — kept local + Google Drive only, not for
# git history (user rule 2026-07-24; supersedes the earlier per-file ignores).
docs/plans/

# UI smoke screenshots contain live account data (account number, balances, positions,
# P&L, order IDs) — kept local + Google Drive only, never committed (user rule 2026-07-24).
docs/panel/screenshots/

# Firecrawl CLI local cache — `firecrawl scrape/crawl/search` writes fetched page content
# here by default. Scraped output is arbitrary third-party content and may carry private
# or licensed material, so it never belongs in git. The CLI is dev tooling only; ClaudIA's
# own web tools go through ibkr_core_mcp, not this cache (added 2026-08-01).
.firecrawl/

# Live account data captured for regression evidence — NEVER commit.
# The repo is public; these hold real fills, balances and position quantities.
# They are kept locally (and on Drive) so the tests that need them can run here.
tests/fixtures/live_fills_*.json
tests/fixtures/account_state_*.json
docs/audits/*-order-fill-evidence.md

# Project status / live test log — kept LOCAL (and on Drive) by decision 2026-08-06.
# It accumulates real P&L figures, balances and order ids from every live session, and
# this repo is public. Untracking stops future additions; the existing history is not
# rewritten (same decision as the 2026-07-24 screenshots).
docs/project-status.md

# Browser artifacts written into the working tree (2026-08-07). The tooling saves a
# page dump or a screenshot to whatever root-level name it is handed, and a session
# driving the dashboard renders live account data into every one of them. Two reached
# commits the same day: a .yml dump carrying net liquidation, cash, positions and P&L,
# and a .png screenshot of the pane. Neither was pushed; both were removed.
#
# **Extensions, not one extension.** The first version of this block listed only
# /*.yml and /*.yaml, because that was the artifact in hand — and the screenshot went
# straight through it. A control written around the instance you just found is not a
# control over the class.
#
# Root-anchored, so .github/workflows/*.yml and claudia/assets/*.png stay trackable.
/*.yml
/*.yaml
/*.json
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
/*.har
/*.log
